WEBVTT

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.130 --> 00:22.180
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

02:12.370 --> 02:13.510
<b>What was that?</b>

02:13.510 --> 02:15.040
<b>I’m not sure...</b>

02:15.840 --> 02:16.840
<b>Huh?</b>

02:20.680 --> 02:22.020
<b>Hey...</b>

02:23.390 --> 02:24.690
<b>What’s going on here?</b>

02:42.480 --> 02:49.450
<b>Urban Folklore</b>

02:50.280 --> 02:52.180
<b>Yes, yes.</b>

02:52.180 --> 02:53.810
<b>I’m well aware of that.</b>

02:53.820 --> 02:57.990
<b>Of course I’ll leave that matter to you, Hana-san.</b>

02:54.750 --> 02:56.750
<b>I’m home.</b>

02:57.990 --> 03:00.920
<b>Well, I guess we’ll leave
things at that, then.</b>

03:00.920 --> 03:02.960
<b>Yep. I’ll be counting on you as always.</b>

03:04.030 --> 03:05.660
<b>Was that Hana-san?</b>

03:05.660 --> 03:07.230
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:15.300 --> 03:16.870
<b>What’s this?</b>

03:15.310 --> 03:20.610
<b>The Summer Of The Fairies</b>

03:15.310 --> 03:20.610
<b>\h\h\h\h\h\hThe Material Fairies\h\h\h</b>

03:15.310 --> 03:20.610
<b>Sukawara Akira</b>

03:16.870 --> 03:18.310
<b>Oh, that?</b>

03:18.310 --> 03:20.610
<b>The guest who just stopped by left it here.</b>

03:20.610 --> 03:21.840
<b>She left this?</b>

03:21.840 --> 03:24.110
<b>She said she wrote it.</b>

03:24.110 --> 03:26.650
<b>Oh? So it was an author this time?</b>

03:26.650 --> 03:30.750
<b>Nope. She said she was a journalist.</b>

03:30.750 --> 03:32.520
<b>She apparently came here
looking for work...</b>

03:32.520 --> 03:36.790
<b>...and was asking if she might be able to get
a short, two-month contract with someone.</b>

03:36.790 --> 03:42.100
<b>Shouldn’t she just go to a weekly or monthly
magazine or newspaper for something like that?</b>

03:42.100 --> 03:45.170
<b>She said she wanted to do some
news for a local place...</b>

03:45.170 --> 03:48.100
<b>...and the places that tend to be strong
around localities are the realtors.</b>

03:48.100 --> 03:50.740
<b>Basically, places like my real estate agency here.</b>

03:53.580 --> 03:56.040
<b>And because of that,
you went to Hana-san?</b>

03:56.040 --> 03:58.410
<b>Yeah, you hit it on the nose.</b>

03:58.410 --> 04:02.580
<b>Hana-san’s been complaining about how
having an empty room is wasteful.</b>

04:02.580 --> 04:07.090
<b>So... that person’s going to be living at Hana-san’s?</b>

04:07.090 --> 04:11.790
<b>If she likes Hana-san,
and Hana-san likes her...</b>

04:11.790 --> 04:15.660
<b>...it’ll probably end up like that,
but nothing’s decided yet.</b>

04:17.270 --> 04:19.170
<b>Can I borrow this book?</b>

04:19.170 --> 04:21.900
<b>Take it. I probably won’t read it anyway.</b>

04:21.900 --> 04:24.070
<b>I guess you’re right there.</b>

04:44.090 --> 04:45.430
<b>Bun-chan.</b>

04:49.360 --> 04:52.070
<b>Have you remembered your name yet?</b>

05:01.880 --> 05:03.380
<b>Makki, huh?</b>

05:03.380 --> 05:08.360
<b>There’s something I want to talk
to you about. Do you want to
meet somewhere now?</b>

05:10.850 --> 05:12.690
<b>Well, guess it couldn’t hurt.</b>

05:13.830 --> 05:14.330
<b>Sure</b>

05:14.330 --> 05:14.960
<b>Sure</b>

05:14.960 --> 05:16.160
<b>Sure</b>

05:27.870 --> 05:33.070
<b>“And without a doubt, a being invisible to
the naked eye existed in that valley.”</b>

05:37.980 --> 05:39.350
<b>Rieko.</b>

05:39.350 --> 05:40.680
<b>What is it?</b>

05:40.680 --> 05:43.520
<b>That person I was talking about before
will be staying with Hana-san after all.</b>

05:43.520 --> 05:47.020
<b>Since you seemed interested,
I thought I’d let you know.</b>

06:00.870 --> 06:01.800
<b>I’m here.</b>

06:01.800 --> 06:05.410
<b>Wait a sec, let me save my game.</b>

06:12.450 --> 06:13.880
<b>Umm...</b>

06:15.720 --> 06:17.250
<b>Did you bring it with you?</b>

06:18.220 --> 06:19.920
<b>Is it in there?</b>

06:21.160 --> 06:22.660
<b>What are you talking about?,</b>

06:23.630 --> 06:25.560
<b>I saw it...</b>

06:29.260 --> 06:30.770
<b>I saw it.</b>

06:31.970 --> 06:33.030
<b>Saw what?</b>

06:33.900 --> 06:36.270
<b>The thing you showed Kobayakawa.</b>

06:36.270 --> 06:38.810
<b>That thing you took out of your bag...</b>

06:38.810 --> 06:41.310
<b>That thing you can see but can’t see.</b>

06:50.550 --> 06:53.120
<b>Did you... tell anyone about it?</b>

06:55.320 --> 06:57.630
<b>No...</b>

06:57.630 --> 06:58.730
<b>Really?</b>

07:01.400 --> 07:04.030
<b>I haven’t told anyone...</b>

07:04.730 --> 07:07.000
<b>Please don’t.</b>

07:07.540 --> 07:09.070
<b>Please.</b>

07:09.070 --> 07:10.970
<b>Okay...</b>

07:13.280 --> 07:15.140
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:15.140 --> 07:16.440
<b>I’ll be going now.</b>

07:16.450 --> 07:17.750
<b>Okay.</b>

07:21.250 --> 07:23.180
<b>Hey, you.</b>

07:29.620 --> 07:31.830
<b>Sorry for startling you.</b>

07:42.940 --> 07:44.670
<b>A journalist?</b>

07:44.670 --> 07:45.840
<b>That’s right.</b>

07:45.840 --> 07:48.740
<b>And... I didn’t mean to eavesdrop, but...</b>

07:48.740 --> 07:51.310
<b>...when you said “the thing you
can see but can’t see...”</b>

07:51.310 --> 07:53.680
<b>...my antenna instantly swiveled your way.</b>

07:55.120 --> 07:58.120
<b>Hey, I was wondering
if you’d tell me about it?</b>

07:58.120 --> 08:01.760
<b>If you were listening, you should
know what was said next.</b>

08:01.760 --> 08:04.930
<b>I have no intention...
of telling anyone about it.</b>

08:04.930 --> 08:06.260
<b>Okay.</b>

08:06.260 --> 08:10.060
<b>You haven’t told anyone about it yet,
and you don’t intend to anytime soon.</b>

08:10.070 --> 08:11.100
<b>Understood.</b>

08:11.100 --> 08:12.900
<b>But that’s all right.</b>

08:12.900 --> 08:17.240
<b>If you ever start thinking
you want to talk about it...</b>

08:17.240 --> 08:20.910
<b>...would you please call the number on this card?</b>

08:20.910 --> 08:22.680
<b>Okay?</b>

08:22.680 --> 08:24.580
<b>I don’t think I will...</b>

08:24.580 --> 08:27.720
<b>That’s fine, too.
There’s nothing I can do about that.</b>

08:29.050 --> 08:32.620
<b>Bye. I’ll be waiting, even though
I don’t expect you to call.</b>

08:46.300 --> 08:49.140
<b>“Su-ka-wa-ra. Be careful not to misread it!”</b>

08:50.940 --> 08:52.410
<b>It really is you!</b>

08:53.410 --> 08:55.410
<b>Do I know you...?</b>

08:55.410 --> 08:57.380
<b>I come from Tana.</b>

08:57.380 --> 08:59.710
<b>The name’s Miyama Mika.</b>

08:59.720 --> 09:01.450
<b>Miyama!</b>

09:01.450 --> 09:03.580
<b>Incidentally enough...</b>

09:03.590 --> 09:06.890
<b>...I was also there on the night of the
Cat Dance the year before last.</b>

09:06.890 --> 09:07.960
<b>So you saw.</b>

09:07.960 --> 09:08.960
<b>Yes.</b>

09:08.960 --> 09:11.160
<b>But anyway, what brings you
to Yokohama, Sukawara-san?</b>

09:11.160 --> 09:12.930
<b>Ah, well... work.</b>

09:12.930 --> 09:15.700
<b>For Tana’s <i>local</i> cable news?</b>

09:15.700 --> 09:17.260
<b>You sure have a way with words...</b>

09:17.270 --> 09:19.900
<b>But actually, I’m a freelance reporter now.</b>

09:19.900 --> 09:23.770
<b>You quit 39 Cable TV?</b>

09:23.770 --> 09:25.040
<b>Well, yeah...</b>

09:25.040 --> 09:30.380
<b>I decided to quit working for a company and
work for my own self-fulfillment instead.</b>

09:30.380 --> 09:32.650
<b>If you know me from my time at 39...</b>

09:32.650 --> 09:34.650
<b>...I’ll be counting on you to cheer me on!</b>

09:34.650 --> 09:36.880
<b>Or something like that.</b>

09:36.890 --> 09:38.190
<b>Bye now.</b>

09:40.330 --> 09:45.300
<b>Kitchen</b>

09:40.330 --> 09:45.300
<b>Tokimiya</b>

09:46.460 --> 09:47.800
<b>Huh?</b>

09:47.800 --> 09:49.760
<b>You’re supposed to be off today.</b>

09:49.770 --> 09:54.170
<b>I heard you got a tenant, Grammy,
so I thought I’d stop by.</b>

09:54.170 --> 09:56.200
<b>You interested in her?</b>

09:56.200 --> 09:58.870
<b>I’d be lying if I said I wasn’t.</b>

09:58.870 --> 10:03.780
<b>Well, she said she was going out shopping,
but I think she should be back soon.</b>

10:03.780 --> 10:06.050
<b>Want to work while waiting?</b>

10:07.820 --> 10:09.280
<b>I guess that works.</b>

10:09.280 --> 10:11.290
<b>Then, could you peel those potatoes over there?</b>

10:11.290 --> 10:12.520
<b>Yes, ma’am.</b>

10:19.560 --> 10:21.900
<b>Oh, it’s just you, Shigeki.</b>

10:23.900 --> 10:25.870
<b>What’s up with that greeting?</b>

10:31.410 --> 10:33.840
<b>Sorry, I’ll be back.</b>

10:33.840 --> 10:35.080
<b>What happened?</b>

10:35.080 --> 10:36.680
<b>It’s Kisa.</b>

10:36.680 --> 10:38.150
<b>It looks like something happened.</b>

10:38.150 --> 10:40.550
<b>I’ll be out for a little, then.</b>

10:40.550 --> 10:41.720
<b>Kisa?</b>

10:46.120 --> 10:47.960
<b>Rieko, the potatoes.</b>

10:47.960 --> 10:49.560
<b>Ah, yeah.</b>

10:49.560 --> 10:53.160
<b>Not “yeah.”
You’re working, so “yes, ma’am.”</b>

10:53.160 --> 10:54.600
<b>Yes, ma’am.</b>

11:26.190 --> 11:30.770
<b>You hardly ever exercise, so this is what
happens when you run so suddenly.</b>

11:32.100 --> 11:33.400
<b>It’s just that...</b>

11:33.400 --> 11:36.170
<b>Should I get you something to drink?</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:37.570
<b>No...</b>

11:37.570 --> 11:39.370
<b>I’m fine.</b>

11:40.080 --> 11:42.440
<b>What did your text message mean?</b>

11:42.440 --> 11:45.080
<b>Makki... said he saw it.</b>

11:45.080 --> 11:47.050
<b>That thing from the other day?</b>

11:47.050 --> 11:48.620
<b>Is that what he was talking about?</b>

11:49.480 --> 11:54.360
<b>The thing you can see but can’t
see that I had in here...</b>

11:54.360 --> 11:57.560
<b>He said he saw it...</b>

12:05.170 --> 12:06.130
<b>And?</b>

12:07.040 --> 12:09.970
<b>What do you want to do, Kisa?</b>

12:09.970 --> 12:11.270
<b>Even if you ask me...</b>

12:12.510 --> 12:14.340
<b>I told you the other day.</b>

12:14.340 --> 12:16.840
<b>You don’t want other people
to find out about it, right?</b>

12:16.850 --> 12:18.510
<b>Yeah...</b>

12:19.120 --> 12:22.680
<b>Since it’s Makki, he won’t just start
talking about it to strangers.</b>

12:22.680 --> 12:23.650
<b>Really?</b>

12:23.650 --> 12:26.490
<b>Yeah. You have nothing to worry about.</b>

12:45.410 --> 12:46.470
<b>I’m back.</b>

12:46.480 --> 12:48.140
<b>Welcome back.</b>

12:50.750 --> 12:52.310
<b>Sugawara-san?</b>

12:52.310 --> 12:55.420
<b>It’s Su<i>ka</i>wara.
Be careful not to misread it.</b>

12:55.420 --> 12:56.950
<b>Umm...</b>

12:56.950 --> 13:00.020
<b>I’m the daughter of the realtor,
and I work part-time here.</b>

13:01.190 --> 13:02.890
<b>Umm...</b>

13:02.890 --> 13:05.630
<b>That book... is fiction, right?</b>

13:05.630 --> 13:08.160
<b>You read the book I left there.</b>

13:08.160 --> 13:10.100
<b>I’m still in the middle of reading it...</b>

13:10.100 --> 13:13.670
<b>I really wanted to write it
as nonfiction, but...</b>

13:14.870 --> 13:18.510
<b>...then I joined the outrageous world
of books, and things got messy.</b>

13:18.510 --> 13:22.580
<b>In short, I guess you’d say the
novel is based on a true story.</b>

13:22.580 --> 13:24.380
<b>Are you teasing me?</b>

13:24.380 --> 13:26.350
<b>Not at all.</b>

13:28.250 --> 13:29.820
<b>The potatoes.</b>

