13:51.510 --> 13:51.750
<b>this letter.</b>

14:12.860 --> 14:16.960
<b>So I guess this’ll be my base of operations, huh?</b>

14:22.440 --> 14:25.070
<b>I know I’m bringing this up again, but...</b>

14:25.070 --> 14:27.910
<b>...when you asked if I’d seen something
I shouldn’t be able to see...</b>

14:27.910 --> 14:30.510
<b>...what did you mean by that?</b>

14:30.510 --> 14:31.410
<b>What did I mean?</b>

14:31.410 --> 14:34.050
<b>Did you hear something from Makki?</b>

14:35.520 --> 14:37.020
<b>Why do you ask?</b>

14:37.020 --> 14:39.490
<b>Why are you asking me
something like that?</b>

14:39.490 --> 14:41.860
<b>Well, that’s...</b>

14:42.760 --> 14:46.290
<b>Does it have anything to do with the
text message you got from Kisa?</b>

14:49.930 --> 14:55.040
<b>If you’re trying to say that a butterfly flapping its
wings in Beijing can cause a storm in New York...</b>

14:55.040 --> 14:57.710
<b>...then it’ll have something to do with you,
no matter what I say.</b>

14:57.710 --> 14:59.040
<b>What’s that supposed to mean?</b>

14:59.040 --> 15:03.810
<b>Simply that everything that happens in
the world is complexly intertwined.</b>

15:03.810 --> 15:05.580
<b>You’re trying to fool me.</b>

15:05.580 --> 15:07.580
<b>That’s not it...</b>

15:07.580 --> 15:08.460
<b>How about this?</b>

15:08.460 --> 15:11.520
<b>lf it really did have something to do with Kisa’s message, what would you do?</b>

15:34.010 --> 15:35.340
<b>Found you.</b>

15:39.310 --> 15:42.120
<b>I had a feeling I’d run into you here.</b>

15:42.120 --> 15:43.350
<b>What is it?</b>

15:43.350 --> 15:47.660
<b>Well, it’d be fine even
if I didn’t see you here...</b>

15:47.660 --> 15:51.390
<b>...but since I did, wanna talk about things?</b>

15:51.390 --> 15:53.060
<b>If it’s about school...</b>

15:53.060 --> 15:54.630
<b>It’s not.</b>

15:54.630 --> 15:57.330
<b>So, can we talk for a bit?</b>

16:00.740 --> 16:02.340
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

16:03.670 --> 16:05.370
<b>Welcome.</b>

16:05.370 --> 16:06.640
<b>I can help the next customer.</b>

16:10.780 --> 16:11.950
<b>Here you go.</b>

16:13.820 --> 16:15.880
<b>Are you... hiding anything from me?</b>

16:16.950 --> 16:18.350
<b>Umm...</b>

16:18.350 --> 16:20.860
<b>I’m going to talk honestly here for a second, okay?</b>

16:20.860 --> 16:24.760
<b>I think everyone has one or two secrets
that they keep to themselves.</b>

16:24.760 --> 16:26.830
<b>So, it’s all right.</b>

16:26.830 --> 16:28.060
<b>But...</b>

16:28.060 --> 16:31.670
<b>...I don’t like it...</b>

16:31.670 --> 16:35.840
<b>...when both you and Shigeki share the same secret.</b>

16:41.940 --> 16:43.280
<b>And...</b>

16:44.610 --> 16:49.880
<b>And... I like it even less when I’m left out,
not knowing anything about it.</b>

16:51.990 --> 16:54.020
<b>There’s nothing like that...</b>

16:54.020 --> 16:56.020
<b>There’s nothing like that, so...</b>

17:06.700 --> 17:07.540
<b>Liar...</b>

17:18.180 --> 17:19.680
<b>Bun-chan.</b>

17:28.390 --> 17:31.130
<b>Always stay by my side.</b>

17:31.130 --> 17:33.060
<b>I don’t want you to go away.</b>

17:36.400 --> 17:39.830
<b>Bun-chan, you’re a good boy.</b>

