18:53.780 --> 18:54.780
<b>You know Yuka, right?!</b>

18:54.780 --> 18:55.380
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:55.380 --> 18:57.880
<b>Apparently, one of
her friend’s friends saw it.</b>

18:57.880 --> 18:59.210
<b>Saw what?</b>

18:59.210 --> 19:02.380
<b>Like I’ve been telling you, some strange
red light balls floating around a cat.</b>

19:02.380 --> 19:05.950
<b>Someone I know was cooking a fish
she bought from the supermarket...</b>

19:05.950 --> 19:10.890
<b>...and some pale blue light came out
of it and then their computer died.</b>

19:10.890 --> 19:14.400
<b>What’s up with that?
That sounds so creepy...</b>

19:14.400 --> 19:15.160
<b>What’s the matter?</b>

19:15.160 --> 19:18.130
<b>Sorry, there’s something I have to do.</b>

19:19.600 --> 19:20.740
<b>Her boyfriend?</b>

19:20.740 --> 19:22.600
<b>Yeah, right.</b>

19:28.380 --> 19:29.810
<b>Umm...</b>

19:29.810 --> 19:32.280
<b>You didn’t reply to my e-mails, so...</b>

19:32.280 --> 19:34.250
<b>I was worried.</b>

19:34.250 --> 19:37.020
<b>But you look the same as usual...</b>

19:37.020 --> 19:38.590
<b>...so I’m relieved.</b>

19:38.590 --> 19:39.550
<b>Were you waiting for me?</b>

19:42.290 --> 19:46.330
<b>Were you waiting over there for me to pass by?</b>

19:46.330 --> 19:47.700
<b>Yeah...</b>

19:48.600 --> 19:51.000
<b>Would you quit doing
things like that, please?</b>

19:51.000 --> 19:52.530
<b>It’s just that...</b>

19:52.530 --> 19:55.570
<b>I guess I must’ve been a little too worried...</b>

19:55.570 --> 19:59.610
<b>...since you always respond
to my e-mails right away...</b>

19:59.610 --> 20:00.880
<b>Makki.</b>

20:00.880 --> 20:01.780
<b>What is it?</b>

20:04.250 --> 20:06.580
<b>Could you keep away from me for a bit?</b>

20:06.580 --> 20:08.120
<b>What do you mean?</b>

20:08.120 --> 20:09.380
<b>Just what I said.</b>

20:09.990 --> 20:13.690
<b>And I don’t care about things you
shouldn’t be able to see, either.</b>

20:13.690 --> 20:17.760
<b>But... you’re the one who brought
that up in the first place...</b>

20:17.760 --> 20:19.590
<b>You’re right. I’m sorry.</b>

20:19.590 --> 20:22.800
<b>Anyway, leave me alone from now on.</b>

20:28.200 --> 20:29.470
<b>You can have this.</b>

20:30.740 --> 20:31.640
<b>Thank you...</b>

20:31.640 --> 20:33.340
<b>Bye now.</b>

21:19.150 --> 21:22.620
<b>I wonder... exactly what
changed your mind?</b>

21:39.780 --> 21:40.940
<b>What do you think of this?</b>

21:42.910 --> 21:47.050
<b>Is this the thing you could but couldn’t
see that you were talking about?</b>

21:47.050 --> 21:48.720
<b>I’m not sure...</b>

21:48.720 --> 21:50.750
<b>At first, that’s what I thought.</b>

21:50.750 --> 21:52.090
<b>But...</b>

21:52.920 --> 21:54.060
<b>After I read this...</b>

21:54.060 --> 21:56.290
<b>I wasn’t so sure anymore...</b>

21:56.290 --> 22:00.090
<b>...since you wrote that material
fairies can’t be caught on film...</b>

22:00.100 --> 22:02.600
<b>So you read it...</b>

22:02.600 --> 22:04.070
<b>I’m glad.</b>

22:06.100 --> 22:07.200
<b>They do exist, don’t they?</b>

22:08.600 --> 22:10.600
<b>Material fairies.</b>

22:10.610 --> 22:11.640
<b>Yes.</b>

22:12.110 --> 22:14.880
<b>And you’ve come to Yokohama to confirm it, right?</b>

22:14.880 --> 22:16.440
<b>Right.</b>

22:16.450 --> 22:17.610
<b>I’ll help you out.</b>

22:18.410 --> 22:19.680
<b>I’ll help you out, so...</b>

22:21.150 --> 22:23.220
<b>Lend me your strength.</b>

22:24.690 --> 22:26.250
<b>Okay.</b>

22:30.730 --> 22:32.290
<b>All right.</b>

22:32.290 --> 22:33.330
<b>What?</b>

22:33.330 --> 22:35.860
<b>Come on, high five!</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.970 --> 24:22.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:20.500 --> 24:22.540
<b>Huh? Grandma and Rokkun aren’t here.</b>

24:22.540 --> 24:23.740
<b>Huh, huh?!</b>

24:23.740 --> 24:24.910
<b>I guess I have no choice.</b>

24:24.910 --> 24:27.880
<b>I’ll have to do the entire preview
all by myself.</b>

24:27.880 --> 24:29.540
<b>Those two are so irresponsible.</b>

24:30.050 --> 24:33.010
<b>In the first place, isn’t the preview supposed
to be an important time...</b>

24:33.020 --> 24:36.020
<b>...where you give a small glimpse of the
great scenes from the next episode?</b>

24:36.020 --> 24:38.250
<b>Really, Grandma and Roku have no
sense of these types of things.</b>

24:38.250 --> 24:40.480
<b>Which is why cute little me...</b>

24:40.480 --> 24:43.460
<b>...should be up more, more, more in the front instead of talking in the back...</b>

24:43.460 --> 24:48.200
<b>...to give off my youthful energy
to all of our viewers out there.</b>

24:48.200 --> 24:50.460
<b>You’ve ruined everything with your talking, geez!</b>

24:50.470 --> 24:53.330
<b>Next time: “A Huge, Invisible Something.”</b>

24:53.340 --> 24:55.270
<b>That character’s going to be back.</b>

24:55.000 --> 24:59.950
<b>A Huge, Invisible Something</b>

24:55.270 --> 24:57.770
<b>Who, who?! I wanna know!</b>
